{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有：X把人物叙述压成较碎的短句，少数地方不如Y左栏的完整句子自然顺畅，尤其是交代犹豫和决定之间的过渡时。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的放大高亮让我听着音乐扫一眼就能抓住每段的心理转折，感受又跟着音乐到时出现，不必同时筛选大量短词；Y虽然句子更顺，但右栏常常堆着不同阶段甚至相反的感受，短时间内很难判断它们分别对应哪里。X把舍不得、用受过的气压住想念、害怕孤单、重新作决定这些因果关系逐段接起来，让我更容易理解他为什么反复动摇，也更能感到这是同一个人一路走来的变化。X的细腻不只是形容更美，而是把短暂高兴、随即心酸、抵抗疲惫、仍然害怕却开始往前走等不同状态区分开了，音乐中的具体变化也更容易和人物心情对上。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bd92d6b6-cec4-4664-a0d2-b280cd09726d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T032716490544Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:28:46.026671+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c3890d680fefa1b0ed9d2299311118758a38cdb2702f968d119dd542e5b0a7e3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee